{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0150C0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"执行CO-OPS时，与同伴之间的信任关系极其重要。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"当然。我可不想把后背交给一个不值得信任的人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"衡量这种关系的指标就是『友情度』。你可以把它理解为与CO-OPS同伴之间羁绊强度的表示。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":120,"review_flag":"AUX_TERM_NORMALIZED_TO_JPN"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"对同伴做出的友好行动越多，与那名同伴的友情度就越高。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"比如说。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"比起分开作战，CO-OP IN时友情度会上升。用心脏按摩救活濒死的同伴，也会加深彼此的羁绊。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":122,"review_flag":"AUX_CPR_EXPANSION_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"反过来，要是<R=误射同伴,友军误伤>之类把同伴打伤了，友情度就会下降。","cn_control_tokens":"<R=误射同伴,友军误伤>","cn_utf8_bytes":98,"review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED; AUX_TRUNCATED_JPN_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"那当然。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"友情度在下次和同一个人执行CO-OPS时也会保留下来。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":"AUX_MEANING_DRIFT_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"不过，如果很长时间不和那个人参加CO-OPS，却不断和新的同伴执行CO-OPS，与那个人的友情度就会恢复到初始状态。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":150,"review_flag":"AUX_PARTIAL_JPN_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"注意这点。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":"AUX_ROW_MISALIGNMENT_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"明白。到时候再重新培养老交情吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"Snake Sync时的效果会受友情度影响。友情度当然是越高越好，对吧？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":88,"review_flag":"AUX_PARTIAL_JPN_DETAIL_RESTORED"}]}